{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>בשר בנפשו.</b> He forbade them a limb from a living creature — that is, as long as its life is in it, you shall not eat the flesh." "<b>בנפשו דמו.</b> While its life is still in it." "<b>בשר בנפשו לא תאכלו.</b> Behold, a limb from a living creature; and 'בנפשו דמו לא תאכלו' — behold, blood from a living creature."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:03.665298146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}